## Project Structure

```
lib/
├── main.dart                    # App entry point
├── models/
│   ├── employee.dart            # Employee data model
│   └── attendance.dart          # Attendance record model
├── services/
│   ├── database_service.dart    # SQLite database operations
│   ├── face_embedding_service.dart  # TFLite face recognition
│   ├── face_detection_service.dart  # MLKit face detection (unused)
│   └── attendance_service.dart  # Business logic orchestration
└── screens/
    ├── kiosk_screen.dart        # Main punch screen
    └── admin/
        ├── enrollment_screen.dart  # Employee registration
        └── reports_screen.dart     # Attendance reports
```

