### 📄 [lib/main.dart](file:///Users/webnox/Documents/Flutter_projects/biometric/lib/main.dart)
**Purpose:** Application entry point and configuration

```dart
void main() async {
  WidgetsFlutterBinding.ensureInitialized();
  
  // Lock to portrait mode for kiosk
  await SystemChrome.setPreferredOrientations([DeviceOrientation.portraitUp]);
  
  // Hide status bar for kiosk mode (immersive)
  await SystemChrome.setEnabledSystemUIMode(SystemUiMode.immersiveSticky);
  
  runApp(const BiometricApp());
}
```

**Key Features:**
- Portrait orientation lock
- Immersive kiosk mode (hides status/nav bars)
- Dark theme configuration

