### 📄 [lib/services/database_service.dart](file:///Users/webnox/Documents/Flutter_projects/biometric/lib/services/database_service.dart)
**Purpose:** SQLite database operations

**Database Schema:**
```sql
-- employees table
CREATE TABLE employees (
  id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY AUTOINCREMENT,
  employee_id TEXT NOT NULL UNIQUE,  -- User-defined ID
  name TEXT NOT NULL,
  department TEXT,
  face_embedding TEXT NOT NULL,       -- Comma-separated floats
  created_at INTEGER
);

-- attendance table
CREATE TABLE attendance (
  id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY AUTOINCREMENT,
  employee_id INTEGER REFERENCES employees(id),
  punch_type TEXT CHECK (punch_type IN ('IN', 'OUT')),
  timestamp INTEGER,
  date TEXT
);
```

**Key Methods:**
| Method | Description |
|--------|-------------|
| [insertEmployee()](file:///Users/webnox/Documents/Flutter_projects/biometric/lib/services/database_service.dart#58-62) | Add new employee |
| [getAllEmployees()](file:///Users/webnox/Documents/Flutter_projects/biometric/lib/services/database_service.dart#63-68) | Get all registered employees |
| [getEmployeeByEmployeeId()](file:///Users/webnox/Documents/Flutter_projects/biometric/lib/services/database_service.dart#80-90) | Find by user-defined ID |
| [employeeIdExists()](file:///Users/webnox/Documents/Flutter_projects/biometric/lib/services/database_service.dart#91-95) | Check if ID already taken |
| [insertAttendance()](file:///Users/webnox/Documents/Flutter_projects/biometric/lib/services/database_service.dart#102-106) | Record punch |
| [getLastPunchType()](file:///Users/webnox/Documents/Flutter_projects/biometric/lib/services/database_service.dart#107-119) | Get last punch to toggle IN/OUT |
| [getAttendanceReportByDate()](file:///Users/webnox/Documents/Flutter_projects/biometric/lib/services/database_service.dart#131-151) | Get daily report with IN/OUT times |

