### 📄 [lib/services/face_embedding_service.dart](file:///Users/webnox/Documents/Flutter_projects/biometric/lib/services/face_embedding_service.dart)
**Purpose:** TFLite-based face recognition

**Configuration:**
```dart
static const int _inputSize = 112;        // Model input: 112x112 pixels
static const int _embeddingSize = 192;    // Output: 192-dimensional vector
static const double _matchThreshold = 0.75; // Similarity threshold
```

**Key Methods:**

| Method | Description |
|--------|-------------|
| [initialize()](file:///Users/webnox/Documents/Flutter_projects/biometric/lib/services/face_embedding_service.dart#15-26) | Load MobileFaceNet TFLite model |
| [getEmbedding(imageBytes)](file:///Users/webnox/Documents/Flutter_projects/biometric/lib/services/face_embedding_service.dart#27-58) | Generate 192-dim vector from face image |
| [getAveragedEmbedding(images)](file:///Users/webnox/Documents/Flutter_projects/biometric/lib/services/face_embedding_service.dart#59-85) | Average vectors from 3 angle photos |
| [cosineSimilarity(emb1, emb2)](file:///Users/webnox/Documents/Flutter_projects/biometric/lib/services/face_embedding_service.dart#109-128) | Compare two face vectors (0-1 score) |
| [findBestMatch(embedding, employees)](file:///Users/webnox/Documents/Flutter_projects/biometric/lib/services/face_embedding_service.dart#129-170) | Find matching employee above threshold |

**Face Matching Flow:**
```
1. Capture photo → Decode image
2. Resize to 112x112 → Normalize pixels to [-1, 1]
3. Run TFLite inference → Get 192-dim embedding
4. Compare with all employees using cosine similarity
5. Return best match if score > 0.75, else null
```

