### 📄 [lib/services/attendance_service.dart](file:///Users/webnox/Documents/Flutter_projects/biometric/lib/services/attendance_service.dart)
**Purpose:** Business logic orchestration

**Key Methods:**

| Method | Description |
|--------|-------------|
| [enrollEmployee()](file:///Users/webnox/Documents/Flutter_projects/biometric/lib/services/attendance_service.dart#18-44) | Register new employee with 3 face photos |
| [punchAttendance()](file:///Users/webnox/Documents/Flutter_projects/biometric/lib/services/attendance_service.dart#45-99) | Match face → toggle IN/OUT → record attendance |
| [employeeIdExists()](file:///Users/webnox/Documents/Flutter_projects/biometric/lib/services/database_service.dart#91-95) | Check if employee ID is taken |
| [getAllEmployees()](file:///Users/webnox/Documents/Flutter_projects/biometric/lib/services/database_service.dart#63-68) | Get employee list |
| [getReport()](file:///Users/webnox/Documents/Flutter_projects/biometric/lib/services/attendance_service.dart#105-109) | Get attendance report for date |

**Enrollment Flow:**
```
1. Check if employee ID exists (reject if duplicate)
2. Get averaged embedding from 3 face photos
3. Create Employee record with embedding
4. Save to SQLite database
```

**Punch Flow:**
```
1. Capture face photo
2. Generate embedding
3. Compare with all enrolled employees
4. If match found:
   - Check last punch type for today
   - Toggle to opposite (IN→OUT or OUT→IN)
   - Record attendance
5. If no match: Return "Face not recognized"
```

