### 📄 [lib/screens/kiosk_screen.dart](file:///Users/webnox/Documents/Flutter_projects/biometric/lib/screens/kiosk_screen.dart)
**Purpose:** Main punch interface for employees

**States:**
| State | Display |
|-------|---------|
| `idle` | Camera + "Position face" + VERIFY button |
| `verifying` | Loading spinner |
| `success` | ✅ Employee ID + Name + Punch IN/OUT + Time |
| `error` | ❌ Error message |

**Key Features:**
- Camera preview (front camera)
- Manual VERIFY button (no auto-detection)
- Admin menu (long-press ⚙️)
- Camera reinitialization after navigation

**Admin Menu:**
- Enroll Employee → Opens enrollment screen
- View Reports → Opens reports screen

---

### 📄 [lib/screens/admin/enrollment_screen.dart](file:///Users/webnox/Documents/Flutter_projects/biometric/lib/screens/admin/enrollment_screen.dart)
**Purpose:** Register new employees with face photos

**Input Fields:**
- Employee ID (required, unique)
- Name (required)
- Department (optional)

**3-Angle Capture Flow:**
1. Capture **Front** photo
2. Capture **Left** turn photo
3. Capture **Right** turn photo
4. Show thumbnails for review
5. Click **Enroll Employee** to save

**Features:**
- Progress indicators (1/2/3 circles)
- Angle instructions ("Look straight", "Turn left", etc.)
- Retake all photos option
- Duplicate ID validation

---

### 📄 [lib/screens/admin/reports_screen.dart](file:///Users/webnox/Documents/Flutter_projects/biometric/lib/screens/admin/reports_screen.dart)
**Purpose:** View daily attendance reports

**Features:**
- Date picker (select any date)
- Employee list with:
  - Employee ID badge
  - Name and department
  - First IN time
  - Last OUT time
  - Status badge (Full Day / Present / Absent)
